  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Framework agreements",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Plan > Commercial pipeline",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation requires that a framework agreement must be established on the basis of the procedures set out in procurement legislation. Framework agreements may be set up on a single-supplier or multi-supplier basis and their term must not exceed four years, except where justified in exceptional circumstances.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation also sets out the relevant requirements when awarding call-off contracts. These rules differ depending on whether call-off contracts are awarded directly to an appointed supplier or awarded by means of re-opening competition.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In all circumstances, call-off contracts awarded under a framework agreement must not modify substantially the framework terms.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Framework agreements may be appropriate where the commercial pipeline indicates that there is a need for repeat purchases during a period of up to four years (or longer in exceptional circumstances).",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that future purchasing requirements are taken into account when determining whether a framework agreement would be an appropriate procurement strategy",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that framework agreements are limited to four years unless there are exceptional reasons to justify a longer term.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "See also in the Procurement Act 2023:",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Framework agreements",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
